{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_13243","headline":"酬权器 · 皇甫冉","name":"酬权器","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"南望江南满山雪，此情惆怅将谁说。\n徒随羣吏不曾闲，顾与诸生爲久别。\n闻君静坐转耽书，种树葺茅还旧居。\n终日白云应自足，明年芳草又何如。\n人生有怀若不展，出入公门犹未免。\n回舟朝夕待春风，先报华阳洞深浅。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"皇甫冉","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_13243.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_13243","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"七言古诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}